{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model with multiprofile settings and avgpool aggregation, building on the baseline (config_016) by introducing multiprofile while keeping encoders and fusion consistent. Validation accuracy of 0.6186 and F1 of 0.6103 suggest significant improvement over singleprofile baselines, indicating potential value in multiprofile configurations. Uncertainty remains about the relative contribution of multiprofile versus aggregation methods, and whether alternative aggregation strategies could further enhance performance."
}

